{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And to the altar</b> — two times in the Masorah: למשכן ולמזבח, בין האולם ולמזבח. Hints at the opinion that says the divine speech came to Moses from above the copper altar — i.e., למשכן ולמזבח, that the Shechinah dwells upon the altar, and likewise it is written בין האולם ולמזבח etc., and they said: 'Spare, YHWH, Your people' — for there they would stand and pray."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:20.366781833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}